.TH ZING 1
.SH NAME
zing \- bow and arrow toy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/zing
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Zing
is a bow and arrow toy.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Drag button 1 in the bow box to aim; release to shoot. Enter resets.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB drag in bow box
Aim; release shoots
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/zing.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
